                  "data": "Order ORD-2026-78901: Status SHIPPED. 3 items totaling $247.95. Shipped via FedEx (tracking: FX-9876543210). Estimated delivery: 2026-06-28. Items: 1x Wireless Keyboard K500 ($79.99), 1x USB-C Dock Pro ($129.99), 1x Screen Protector ($37.97).",
